#: src/app/[lang]/terms-of-service/page.tsx:52
msgid "Budgie is a privacy-first, offline-first mobile application designed to help users track expenses, manage budgets, sync bank accounts (optional), monitor investments (stocks and cryptocurrency), track debts and loans, set financial goals, and access AI-powered financial insights. The Service operates primarily on your device, with optional cloud features that require explicit user consent."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/[lang]/license/page.tsx:37
msgid "Budgie is committed to transparency, security, and community collaboration. We believe that open source software is essential for building trust, especially when it comes to financial applications that handle sensitive personal data. By making our source code publicly available, we enable security audits, community contributions, and user verification of our privacy claims."
msgstr ""

